{
  "manifest": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "body": "# Integer-LIF + QAD 与直接 SNN 量化训练效率对比",
        "id": "title",
        "layout": "full",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "body": "## Executive Summary\n\n在 RTX 5090、400×400 输入、AMP 关闭的受控 microbenchmark 中，Integer-LIF + QAD 在同 physical/effective batch=4 时只占 3.047 GiB，而 Direct-LIF + QAT+SQUAT（T=8、full BPTT）为 14.077 GiB；峰值 allocated memory 降低 78.35%，吞吐提高 4.545×。在 effective batch=64、各自最大可运行 physical batch 下，QAD 达 108.54 images/s，SQUAT 为 10.75 images/s，即 10.095×。容量探测显示 QAD 可运行 physical batch=32，SQUAT 为 4。",
        "id": "executive_summary",
        "layout": "full",
        "sourceId": "efficiency_summary",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "cardIds": [
          "matched_memory",
          "matched_speed",
          "capacity_speed",
          "capacity_batch",
          "accuracy_gap"
        ],
        "id": "headline_metrics",
        "layout": "full",
        "type": "metric-strip"
      },
      {
        "body": "## Key Findings\n\n1. **公平显存口径支持主要结论。** 同 physical batch=4 时，SQUAT/QAD 的峰值 allocated memory 比为 4.620×。\n2. **同有效 batch 的训练速度差距更大。** effective batch=64 时，单次 optimizer update 从 5.952s 降至 0.590s；按 25,700 个样本、402 个 updates 的纯训练投影约为 39.88 分钟/epoch 对 3.95 分钟/epoch。\n3. **独立轮次支持速度差异。** 同 batch 的成对轮次加速中位数为 4.599×（block-bootstrap 95% CI 3.551–4.624×）；同有效 batch 为 10.088×（9.701–10.224×）。",
        "id": "key_findings",
        "layout": "full",
        "sourceId": "efficiency_summary",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "chartId": "throughput_chart",
        "id": "throughput",
        "layout": "full",
        "type": "chart"
      },
      {
        "id": "main_results",
        "layout": "full",
        "tableId": "main_table",
        "type": "table"
      },
      {
        "body": "## Mechanism Evidence\n\n在相同 Direct-LIF + QAT+SQUAT 模型、输入与 batch 下，只把 T 从 1 增到 8，峰值显存增至 5.853×，update 时间增至 4.522×。这直接支持：recurrent state/activation 的时间展开与 full BPTT 是基线训练开销的主要来源之一。完整 QAD 相对无教师/KD 的 QIF-STE 多用 0.578 GiB；两者 pooled median update time 比为 1.001×。",
        "id": "mechanism",
        "layout": "full",
        "sourceId": "efficiency_summary",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      {
        "chartId": "timestep_memory_chart",
        "id": "timestep_memory",
